[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "So let me tell you",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.0
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "about the three cycles.",
    "start": 1.16,
    "end": 2.0
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "The first one is",
    "start": 2.16,
    "end": 2.8
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "the factory cycle.",
    "start": 2.8,
    "end": 3.4
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Henry Ford",
    "start": 3.5,
    "end": 4.22
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "comes up with a really cool idea.",
    "start": 4.22,
    "end": 6.5
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "It enables him",
    "start": 7.44,
    "end": 8.66
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "to hire men",
    "start": 8.66,
    "end": 9.7
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "who used to get paid 50 cents a day",
    "start": 9.7,
    "end": 10.7
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "and pay them",
    "start": 10.7,
    "end": 11.7
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "five dollars a day.",
    "start": 11.7,
    "end": 12.7
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Because he's got",
    "start": 13.64,
    "end": 14.66
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "an efficient enough factory.",
    "start": 14.66,
    "end": 15.7
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Well with that sort of advantage",
    "start": 15.82,
    "end": 17.32
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "you can churn out",
    "start": 17.58,
    "end": 18.66
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "a lot of cars.",
    "start": 18.66,
    "end": 19.58
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "You can make a lot of change.",
    "start": 19.62,
    "end": 20.96
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "You can get roads built.",
    "start": 21.0,
    "end": 22.14
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "The essence of what you're doing",
    "start": 25.42,
    "end": 27.02
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "is you need",
    "start": 27.02,
    "end": 27.84
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "ever-cheaper labor,",
    "start": 27.84,
    "end": 28.84
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "and ever-faster machines.",
    "start": 28.84,
    "end": 29.84
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "And the problem we've run into is,",
    "start": 32.52,
    "end": 34.66
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "we're running out of both.",
    "start": 34.66,
    "end": 35.66
  }
]